# Icewrought Sentry (2/3 vigilance): "Whenever this creature attacks, you may pay {1}{U}. When you do, tap target creature an
# opponent controls." and "Whenever you tap an untapped creature an opponent controls, this creature gets +2/+1 until end of turn."
# Turn 3: Bot1 attacks with the Sentry and pays {1}{U}; the reflexive trigger taps Bot2's untapped Llanowar Elves (CR 603.12,
# 701.26a), which is Bot1 tapping an untapped creature, so the Sentry is 4/4 until end of turn. Vigilance keeps the Sentry untapped
# (CR 702.20b) and the tapped Elves cannot block, so Bot2 takes 4 (20 - 4 = 16).

